; n80 test: M80 listing directives — .PRINTX and TITLE
;   .PRINTX: prints content between delimiters (first char is delimiter)
;   TITLE:   consumed silently (no-op for listing header)
;   .PRINTX without space between directive and delimiter (M80 real-world syntax)

    TITLE CPMIO CONSOLE I/O ROUTINES FOR CP/M
    SUBTTL Internal Definitions

    .PRINTX /WITH SPACE/
    .PRINTX !ALTERNATE DELIMITER!
    .PRINTX/NO SPACE BEFORE DELIMITER/

    end
